{"id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-proof-predicate.md","title":"Proof Predicate","display":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-proof-predicate","aliases":["92-df-proof-predicate"],"display":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-proof]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-pr-predicate]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 34–36；第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 51–53、74）","source_status":"证明码的本地重编码"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-proof-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-proof-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"298d80fabfd2a708\" href=\"?note=298d80fabfd2a708\" title=\"92-df-pr-predicate\">92-df-pr-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 34–36；第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 51–53、74）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"证明码的本地重编码"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-proof-predicate-—-Proof-Predicate-$\\mathrm{Prf}_G$\">df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(m,k \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (Gödel numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{G}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{G}\\)</span> (proof relation specialized to system <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqCode}\\)</span> (finite-sequence encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (formula numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span> (definition-target proof-code predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_r)\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^r\\;\\Bigl(\nk=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\ulcorner\\psi_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\\ulcorner\\psi_r\\urcorner\\rangle)\n\\land m=\\ulcorner\\psi_r\\urcorner\n\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{G}(\\langle\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_r\\rangle,\\psi_r)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_r)\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^r\\;\\Bigl(\nk=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\ulcorner\\psi_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\\ulcorner\\psi_r\\urcorner\\rangle)\n\\land m=\\ulcorner\\psi_r\\urcorner\n\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{G}(\\langle\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_r\\rangle,\\psi_r)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>编码一个以编号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>的公式为结论的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明</li>\n<li>对有固定有限元数且公理/规则可判定的演算，裸证明序列关系可判定；无限元数规则须另附见证，且一般递归不能自动加强为 PR</li>\n<li>对本书具体的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，在另行验证逻辑公理、PA归纳实例及规则实例的码检查均为PR后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>才可相应证明为PR</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(m)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(m)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>可由算术公式表示，因而<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span>可取为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>公式</li>\n<li>这是可证性谓词的定义基础</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本文件采用本库素数幂序列码，原书用十三进制拼接。固定 MP/Gen 的前提元数分别为 2、1，所以裸有限证明序列可判定；一般可判定而无限元数的规则关系不自动给出该结论。Remark 中存在性给外部 ProvCode，而对象语言 Prov 只能接收数项。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 III 章 pp. 34–36；第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 51–53、74）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-proof-predicate-—-Proof-Predicate-$\\mathrm{Prf}_G$","text":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate $\\mathrm{Prf}_G$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eab